<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Montgomery cuts Casino Data.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Montgomery cuts Casino Data.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities analyst David McDonald said he downgraded Casino Data Systems to hold from buy and said he did not expect the company to meet fourth quarter earnings expectations.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1997 earnings estimate to $0.65 per share from $0.85 and 1998 estimate to $0.75 per share from $1.05.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3-1/8 to 9-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
